---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="가톨릭문화원 ALMA ART">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[80vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-ivory via-ivory to-sage/20"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.04]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, var(--color-wine) 0%, transparent 40%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, var(--color-gold) 0%, transparent 40%);"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <div class="text-wine text-sm tracking-[0.3em] mb-6 font-semibold">SINCE 1998 · 천주교 인천교구</div>
        <h1 class="serif text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight tracking-tight mb-8">
          건축이 된 기도,<br />
          <span class="text-wine">예술이 된 복음.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-ink/75 leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-10">
          김포 전류리 강변에 자리한 가톨릭문화원 ALMA ART 아트센터.<br />
          예술의전당 설계자 <b>김석철</b> 건축가의 유작에서,<br />
          미사와 공연·전시가 한 자리에서 열립니다.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/programs" class="px-8 py-4 bg-wine text-ivory font-medium hover:bg-wine/90 transition">다가오는 프로그램</a>
          <a href="/reservations" class="px-8 py-4 border border-ink/20 hover:border-wine hover:text-wine transition">예약·신청</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-sm">
        <div class="bg-ivory/60 backdrop-blur border border-ink/5 p-6">
          <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-1">RESIDENT</div>
          <div class="serif text-lg mb-2">한국가톨릭챔버오케스트라</div>
          <div class="text-ink/60">제60회 정기연주회 개최 (2026.09)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ivory/60 backdrop-blur border border-ink/5 p-6">
          <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-1">FILM</div>
          <div class="serif text-lg mb-2">알마아트 (ALMA ART)</div>
          <div class="text-ink/60">《탄생》(2022) 등 제작 참여</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ivory/60 backdrop-blur border border-ink/5 p-6">
          <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-widest mb-1">FESTIVAL</div>
          <div class="serif text-lg mb-2">한국가톨릭어린이영화제</div>
          <div class="text-ink/60">한국교회 최초의 어린이영화제</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider-gold my-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto"></div>

  <!-- Latest video from YouTube -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-1">
        <div class="text-wine text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold mb-3">ONLINE MASS & CONCERT</div>
        <h2 class="serif text-3xl leading-tight mb-4">실비아홀에서<br />온라인으로 만나는<br />미사와 공연</h2>
        <p class="text-ink/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          유튜브 <b>가톨릭문화원 Alma Art</b> 채널에서 주일 미사와 정기연주회를 상시 송출합니다.
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2DFlrmRnNpsMAtaicFeibg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 border border-wine text-wine hover:bg-wine hover:text-ivory transition text-sm">
          채널 전체 보기 →
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-2 aspect-video bg-ink shadow-2xl">
        <iframe
          class="w-full h-full"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/CAErOOmGIQs"
          title="가톨릭문화원 ALMA ART 라이브"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
          allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Spaces overview -->
  <section class="bg-ink text-ivory py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-gold text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold mb-3">SPACES</div>
      <h2 class="serif text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-12">건축가 김석철의 3년, 그리고 실비아의 봉헌</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-sm">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5">
          <div class="serif text-xl text-ivory mb-2">실비아홀</div>
          <div class="text-ivory/60 leading-relaxed">1층 348석 · 2층 108석<br />총 456석 콘서트홀</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5">
          <div class="serif text-xl text-ivory mb-2">데꼴로레스</div>
          <div class="text-ivory/60 leading-relaxed">2층 로비<br />상설 갤러리</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5">
          <div class="serif text-xl text-ivory mb-2">아모르비니아</div>
          <div class="text-ivory/60 leading-relaxed">1층 카페<br />인문학 라운지</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5">
          <div class="serif text-xl text-ivory mb-2">바울라홀</div>
          <div class="text-ivory/60 leading-relaxed">1층 세미나실<br />다목적 공간</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/spaces" class="text-gold hover:text-ivory transition text-sm">공간 자세히 보기 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
    <div class="text-wine text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-semibold mb-3">MISSION</div>
    <p class="serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      "문화예술을 통해<br />가톨릭의 보편적 가치를<br />세상과 나눕니다."
    </p>
    <div class="divider-gold mt-12"></div>
    <div class="mt-8 text-sm text-ink/50">— 가톨릭문화원 ALMA ART</div>
  </section>

</Layout>
